  "solution": {
    "text": "Put,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;is the constant of integration.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>, is the answer.",
